{"kind": "mod", "id": 1799, "name": "Disable Seasonal Events", "slug": "disable-seasonal-events", "teaser": "Simple mod to disable seasonal event detection.\r\nAffects New Years, Christmas, Halloween events.", "owner_name": "schkuromi", "downloads": 15585, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:03:10.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-10-27T13:27:26.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-10-27T13:27:26.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>- Install Instructions</p>\n<p>Drag and drop the user folder into your SPT game folder</p>\n<p>This a simple mod so it shouldn’t conflict with anything (hopefully)</p>\n<p>For reference, these are the Vanilla SPT 3.11.2 dates for seasonal events (based on your computer’s clock)</p>\n<p>In SPT 3.11.2, the ending dates are inclusive, rather than exclusive. So the event will end the day after the end date.</p>\n<p>HalloweenChristmasNew Years<br />\nChristmas JanuaryApril Fools<br />\nStart Date28 October<br />\n12 December<br />\n1 January<br />\n2 January1 April<br />\nEnd Date<br />\n9 November<br />\n31 December<br />\n1 January<br />\n14 January2 April</p>\n<h3>NOTE: This does not affect seasons (snow on the ground/raining), I suggest <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2118-simple-season-selector/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Simple Season Selector</a> for that.</h3>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.8", "content_length": null, "downloads": 970, "published_at": "2024-10-27T13:27:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1799/disable-seasonal-events/1.0.0", "github_ur